    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Four verbs and one infinitive",
     "texto": [
      "All four are followed by an infinitive, as in English: **Posso ir** (I can go), **quero ir** (I want to go), **tenho de ir** (I have to go), **sei nadar** (I know how to swim).",
      "«Have to» is **ter de**: **Tenho de trabalhar**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
