    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "«Saber» or «poder»",
     "texto": [
      "Portuguese separates the two: **saber** means knowing how to do something (**sei conduzir**, I know how to drive), and **poder** means being able or allowed (**não posso ir**, I can't go)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "«Porque»: why and because",
     "texto": [
      "**Porque** means both «why» and «because»: **Porque tens de trabalhar?** (why do you have to work?) – **Porque** temos muito trabalho (because we have a lot of work).",
      "**Hoje** = today. **Amanhã** = tomorrow."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
